      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: My desk. This is where I get the majority of my work done.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4965353625298158766, guid: 442473880b3fb86478972619de29c8aa, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: I keep my trusty laptop here. It's a good thing I bought it before the
        RAM prices went up.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4965353625298158766, guid: 442473880b3fb86478972619de29c8aa, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: I'm currently working on a video game for a game jam. Hopefully it turns
        out well.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
